sequenceDiagram
    participant F as Archivo
    participant FIS as FileInputStream
    participant OIS as ObjectInputStream
    participant P as Programa
    P->>OIS: readObject()
    OIS->>FIS: Leer bytes
    FIS->>F: Cargar desde disco
    F-->>OIS: Bytes
    OIS->>OIS: Reconstruir objeto
    OIS-->>P: ✅ Objeto restaurado
